Third-party models
------------------
AICamPro does not bundle any model weights. `scripts/download_models.sh`
fetches them at install time from their original sources, and each keeps the
licence of its own project:

  RobustVideoMatting (rvm_*.torchscript)
    https://github.com/PeterL1n/RobustVideoMatting
    GPL-3.0

  YuNet face detector (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo
    Apache-2.0

If you redistribute AICamPro together with these weights, the terms of those
licences apply to your distribution.
